# Optional environment for the supervised processes.
# Copy to supervisor.env next to supervisor.sh; it is sourced before any
# check, so the supervised processes inherit these variables (cron does
# not load your shell environment automatically).
#
# Never put real secrets in this file if the repo is shared — pass them
# through the environment instead. Values here are visible to every
# process the supervisor starts.

# Example:
# MY_API_BASE_URL=https://example.com
# WORKER_CONCURRENCY=2
